### Admin Language Management Endpoints
### 
### IMPORTANT: You must login first to get a token!
### Run the login.http request first to authenticate and set the {{token}} variable.
### 
### Template Variable Workaround:
### REST Client interprets {{variable}} as variables. To use literal {{language}} in JSON,
### we define a variable that contains the literal string, or use single braces {language}
### and manually replace with {{language}} when needed.

### Get All Languages
GET http://localhost:28090/api/admin/orchestration/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Language by Code (returns translations JSON)
GET http://localhost:28090/api/admin/orchestration/languages/ru
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Upload New Language (JSON file with 'code' field)
### 
### WORKAROUND: REST Client interprets {{variable}} as variables.
### Option 1: Use single braces {language} below and manually replace with {{language}} in actual requests
### Option 2: Define environment variable: templateVar = "{{language}}" and use {{templateVar}}
### 
### The actual JSON should contain {{language}} for frontend template interpolation
POST http://localhost:28090/api/admin/orchestration/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "de",
  "common": {
    "save": "Speichern",
    "cancel": "Abbrechen",
    "confirm": "Bestätigen",
    "back": "Zurück",
    "next": "Weiter",
    "send": "Senden",
    "loading": "Laden...",
    "error": "Fehler",
    "success": "Erfolg"
  },
  "language": {
    "title": "Sprache",
    "subtitle": "Wählen Sie Ihre bevorzugte Sprache",
    "saveChanges": "Änderungen speichern",
    "changeSuccess": "Sprache erfolgreich geändert zu {language}",
    "english": "Englisch",
    "german": "Deutsch"
  }
}

### Update Language (upload new JSON file)
### 
### WORKAROUND: REST Client interprets {{variable}} as variables.
### Use single braces {language} below and manually replace with {{language}} in actual requests
### The actual JSON should contain {{language}} for frontend template interpolation
PUT http://localhost:28090/api/admin/orchestration/languages/de
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "common": {
    "save": "Speichern",
    "cancel": "Abbrechen",
    "confirm": "Bestätigen",
    "back": "Zurück",
    "next": "Weiter",
    "send": "Senden",
    "loading": "Laden...",
    "error": "Fehler",
    "success": "Erfolg",
    "welcome": "Willkommen"
  },
  "language": {
    "title": "Sprache",
    "subtitle": "Wählen Sie Ihre bevorzugte Sprache",
    "saveChanges": "Änderungen speichern",
    "changeSuccess": "Sprache erfolgreich geändert zu {language}",
    "english": "Englisch",
    "german": "Deutsch"
  }
}

### Delete Language
DELETE http://localhost:28090/api/admin/orchestration/languages/de
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Direct User-Service Endpoints (for testing)

### Get All Languages from User-Service
GET http://localhost:28081/api/v1/users/languages
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Language Translations from User-Service
GET http://localhost:28081/api/v1/users/languages/ru
Content-Type: application/json
